      "value": "Aparrently most of them are enabled, but the most important one that isnt enabled is the angle limiter, It allows for cool ways to disable limbs or enable them with animations as you can keyframe the Limit value, setting it to zero practically turn it off :D So enable the >> script: RotationLimitAngle.cs <<<",
